   227	The graph contains:
   228	\begin{enumerate}
   229	\item a unit-weight clique on $C_t$ vertices, one designated as the hub;
   230	\item $m_t$ unit-weight leaves adjacent only to the hub;
   231	\item $q_t$ disjoint two-vertex satellites, each with internal edge weight
   232	      $W_t=C_t/\sigma_*$;
   233	\item an edge of common weight $\eps_t>0$ from every satellite vertex to
   234	      every clique vertex.
   235	\end{enumerate}
   236	There are no other edges.  In particular, there are no edges between
   237	distinct satellites.
