    52	include provenance and research logs; treat every statement in those files as
    53	an author claim, not evidence.
    54	
    55	## Suggested order
    56	
    57	1. Read the PDF and LaTeX source and make an independent theorem ledger.
    58	2. Inspect the wrapper runner and both integrity checkers,
    59	   `bootstrap_replay.sh`, `replay.sh`, `build.sh`, `release_bundle.sh`,
    60	   `bundle_manifest.py`, `requirements.txt`,
