 1046 \begin{proof}
 1047 For fixed $L$, let $X_L$ be the states with resident hub, no mutant pendants,
 1048 and at most $L$ mutant ordinary vertices; let $Y_L$ be the analogous states
 1049 with mutant hub.  Write $x^U_{C,L}$ and $y^U_{C,L}$ for the largest fixation
 1050 probabilities on these two sets.  Lemma~\ref{lem:killed-green} first gives
