 1105 is precisely the surviving-hub part of the finite-$T$ split; no
 1106 infinite-horizon maximum estimate is being used.
 1107 For fixed $T$, let $L_1\to\infty$ and then let $T\to\infty$; the bound
 1108 vanishes in that order,
 1109 uniformly in $C$ and reciprocal fitness.
