 1289 \section{The simultaneous correction and its optimization}
 1290 
 1291 Put $\eta=q/C$.  Substitution of
 1292 \eqref{eq:center-Bd}--\eqref{eq:center-dB} and
 1293 Proposition~\ref{prop:gate} into the finite trace gives the key asymptotic
 1294 statement.
